# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:528
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_75114474:

    # "King Zorvul Glimmerfang of the goblins was ever a match for King Bramdur Forgeworth, the great dwarven king."
    "O Rei Zorvul Glimmerfang dos goblins sempre foi páreo para o Rei Bramdur Forgeworth, o grande rei anão."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:529
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_6aed5751:

    # "By pure happenstance, Mirgwen Glimmerfang, the goblin princess, and Prince Dorric Forgeworth, heir to the dwarven kingdom, were both reluctantly seeking suitors for marriage."
    "Por pura coincidência, Mirgwen Glimmerfang, a princesa goblin, e o Príncipe Dorric Forgeworth, herdeiro do reino anão, estavam ambos relutantemente buscando pretendentes para casamento."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:530
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_86f3ccdb:

    # "Of course, these marriages were arranged by their fathers, and neither side was supposed to ever meet..."
    "É claro, esses casamentos eram arranjados pelos pais delas, e nenhum dos lados deveria jamais se encontrar..."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:531
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_995db5c5:

    # "By chance, during a terrible storm, the crows delivering the letters to their suitors became confused."
    "Por acaso, durante uma terrível tempestade, os corvos entregando as cartas para seus pretendentes ficaram confusos."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:532
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_79c0b419:

    # "By accident, Mirgwen and Dorric's letters were wrongly delivered to each other."
    "Por acidente, as cartas de Mirgwen e Dorric foram entregues erroneamente um ao outro."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:533
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_5246466f:

    # "The two, perhaps amused at how different their personalities were,"
    "As duas, talvez divertidas com o quão diferentes suas personalidades eram,"

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:534
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_f3c493f0:

    # "Dorric being a poetic romantic and Mirgwen famous for her wit and occasional crudeness, continued to write to each other, unaware of exactly who they were writing to, with both simply marking their names as 'D' and 'M' respectively."
    "Dorric sendo um romântico poético e Mirgwen famosa por sua sagacidade e crueza ocasional, continuaram a escrever um para o outro, sem saber exatamente para quem estavam escrevendo, com ambos simplesmente marcando seus nomes como 'D' e 'M' respectivamente."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:535
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_2787f072:

    # "The two agreed to meet in secret. Mirgwen, expecting to meet another goblin warlord, and Dorric, believing he was speaking to Lady Margott, a noble dwarven lady friendly with the family."
    "Os dois concordaram em se encontrar em segredo. Mirgwen, esperando encontrar outro senhor da guerra goblin, e Dorric, acreditando que estava falando com a Lady Margott, uma nobre dama anã amiga da família."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:536
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_348f7fff:

    # "Mirgwen bathed naked in the hot spring waters, only to be found much earlier than expected by Dorric."
    "Mirgwen se banhava nua nas águas termais, apenas para ser encontrada muito antes do esperado por Dorric."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:537
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_a046beee:

    # "The two drew weapons, but quickly realized who the other person was."
    "Os dois sacaram suas armas, mas rapidamente perceberam quem era a outra pessoa."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:538
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_011e811b:

    # "After some brief confusion, the two left and continued to write to each other. Dorric was completely overtaken by Mirgwen's beauty, not realizing goblins could look like that."
    "Depois de alguma breve confusão, os dois partiram e continuaram a escrever um para o outro. Dorric foi completamente dominado pela beleza de Mirgwen, sem perceber que goblins podiam ter aquela aparência."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:539
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_b193dc63:

    # "Eventually, the two fell in love, and triggered a crisis by openly announcing their engagement."
    "Eventualmente, os dois se apaixonaram, e desencadearam uma crise ao anunciar abertamente seu noivado."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:540
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_21f80159:

    # "On the verge of the war becoming even more violent, Dorric and Mirgwen pleaded with their fathers to meet, threatening to leave Iryiad if they did not."
    "À beira da guerra se tornar ainda mais violenta, Dorric e Mirgwen imploraram aos pais para se encontrarem, ameaçando deixar Iryiad se eles não o fizessem."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:541
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_765ba0c8:

    # "Reluctantly, both sides met, and to their surprise, King Zorvul and Bramdur got along remarkably well."
    "Relutantemente, ambos os lados se encontraram, e para sua surpresa, o Rei Zorvul e Bramdur se deram notavelmente bem."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:542
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_469707ca:

    # "Having never met before, the two first came to have a begrudging respect for the other and then, realizing the full potential of what this marriage could achieve, became allies... and finally, friends."
    "Nunca tendo se encontrado antes, os dois primeiro passaram a ter um respeito relutante um pelo outro e então, percebendo o potencial total do que este casamento poderia alcançar, tornaram-se aliados... e finalmente, amigos."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:543
translate ptBR rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_11fe7db9:

    # "The marriage was approved to the shock of all Iryiad, but to this day, the dwarven and goblin alliance has only grown in strength, with the kingdoms now so entangled in blood, politics, and culture, they live as 'one people, two races.'"
    "The marriage was approved to the shock of all Iryiad, but to this day, the dwarven and goblin alliance has only grown in strength, with the kingdoms now so entangled in blood, politics, and culture, they live as 'one people, two races.'"

